{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05203","headline":"奉和李令扈从温泉宫赐游骊山韦侍郎别业 · 卢僎","name":"奉和李令扈从温泉宫赐游骊山韦侍郎别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风后轩皇佐，云峰谢客居。\n承恩来翠岭，缔赏出丹除。\n飞盖松谿寂，清笳玉洞虚。\n窥岩详雾豹，过水略泉鱼。\n乡入无何有，时还上古初。\n伊臯羞过狭，魏丙服麤疎。\n白雪缘情降，青霞落卷舒。\n多惭郎署在，輙继国风余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}